      "updated": 1792643480955,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "② 初始化批次（root key 签，一起成功或一起回滚）\n    approveNative(ERC20ETH, 0)\n    register(session key)\n    update(keyHash, {hook, 过期 = 现在 + 24 h})\n    hook.setPolicy(keyHash, policy)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "② 初始化批次（root key 签，一起成功或一起回滚）\n    approveNative(ERC20ETH, 0)\n    register(session key)\n    update(keyHash, {hook, 过期 = 现在 + 24 h})\n    hook.setPolicy(keyHash, policy)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.45
    },
