      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792643480955,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "授权在执行之前就生效：初始化批次失败，\n委托也不会撤销，账户停在 DELEGATED，\n重新跑 account init 即可。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "授权在执行之前就生效：初始化批次失败，\n委托也不会撤销，账户停在 DELEGATED，\n重新跑 account init 即可。",
      "autoResize": true,
